<title>UK: Benetton to launch 500 billion lire FRN.</title>
<headline>Benetton to launch 500 billion lire FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Benetton Group SpA will launch a 500 billion lire five-year FRN next week, IMI Bank Lux said on Thursday as joint lead manager.</p>
<p>The notes will pay three-month LIBOR plus 12.5 basis points.</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities and Banca Nazionale del Lavoro will also be joint lead managers. The deal will be launched on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
